  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Chen Fu observes his sons and is bewildered.",
  "[action] Chen Fu sits on the threshold, staring at his sons.",
  "[action] Chen Fu's sons are in a room.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Chen Fu calls his sons to him.",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Come now out of that room---come!\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Chen Fu walks out with his sons.",
  "[action] The eldest son and the second son follow their father.",
  "[says] Chen Fu speaks to his sons while they walk.",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Where are you going? Why this haste?\"",
  "[action] The eldest son and the second son stop walking.",
  "[action] The eldest son and the second son sit down.",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and I suppose you are going to your rooms, and well you may, for you have been in there a long time.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Chen Fu sits down beside his sons.",
  "[action] (to Chen Fu, the second son) The eldest son and the second son stand up.",
  "[says] Chen Fu asks his sons where they have been.",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Now where have you been?\"",
  "[action] The eldest son and the second son follow their father.",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son, the second son): \"You two have been together all this day, and what have you been about?\"",
  "the second son (to Chen Fu): \"Only to the fields, father,\"",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son): \"Have you been to the west fields?\""
